  General-Gold-Tracker/Data/General-Gold-Tracker_Instances: General-Gold-Tracker_Instances
  General-Gold-Tracker/Data/General-Gold-Tracker_Drops: General-Gold-Tracker_Drops
  General-Gold-Tracker/Data/General-Gold-Tracker_Materials: General-Gold-Tracker_Materials
  General-Gold-Tracker/Data/General-Gold-Tracker_Farms: General-Gold-Tracker_Farms
  General-Gold-Tracker/Data/General-Gold-Tracker_TSMRealmData: General-Gold-Tracker_TSMRealmData
  General-Gold-Tracker/Data/General-Gold-Tracker_MapData: General-Gold-Tracker_MapData
